    <field name="scopecontent_teim">COMMERCIAL: Homo Xtra (HX), &#34;The one. The only. The original.&#34;</field>
    <field name="scopecontent_teim">1. Andy Humm and Barbara Raab discuss recent general events that relate to the LGBT community.</field>
    <field name="scopecontent_teim">2. Interview: Mitchell Anderson, actor, discusses &#34;Visiting Mr. Green&#34;, a play in which he stars. </field>
    <field name="scopecontent_teim">3. AIDS News</field>
    <field name="scopecontent_teim">4. Entertainment</field>
    <field name="scopecontent_teim">5. Andrew Taines interviews Jeff Krell, author, and Craig Dawson, actor, regarding Krell&#39;s comic strip &#34;Jayson&#34; and its stage production.</field>
    <field name="scopecontent_teim">6. Lou Maletta interviews Alvino Najar, artist and sculptor, regarding his artwork and personal life.</field>
